sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Service<br/>443/TCP → 9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DSCICtrl as DSCInitializationReconciler
    participant DSCCtrl as DataScienceClusterReconciler
    participant SecretCtrl as SecretGeneratorReconciler
    participant Mesh as Service Mesh<br/>data-science-smcp
    participant Gateway as Istio Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over Admin,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Platform Initialization
    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create DSCInitialization CR<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-opendatahub-io-v1<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Allowed (singleton check)
    K8sAPI-->>Admin: DSCI created
    DSCICtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch DSCI<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    DSCICtrl->>K8sAPI: Create applications namespace
    DSCICtrl->>K8sAPI: Configure monitoring (ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule)
    DSCICtrl->>K8sAPI: Configure Service Mesh (SMCP, SMMR)
    DSCICtrl->>K8sAPI: Distribute trusted CA bundles

    Note over Admin,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Component Lifecycle Management
    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create DataScienceCluster CR<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-opendatahub-io-v1<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Allowed (singleton check)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-opendatahub-io-v1<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Set ModelRegistry defaults
    K8sAPI-->>Admin: DSC created
    DSCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch DSC<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    DSCCtrl->>K8sAPI: Deploy kustomize manifests<br/>for each Managed component
    SecretCtrl->>K8sAPI: Generate OAuth secrets<br/>Create OAuthClient

    Note over Client,Gateway: Flow 3: KServe Traffic Routing
    Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS
    Gateway->>K8sAPI: Route to InferenceService<br/>HTTP/80 (mesh-internal)
